TI  - Skeletal muscle-specific DJ-1 ablation-induced atrogenes expression and mitochondrial dysfunction contributing to muscular atrophy.
AU  - Zhang, Shuang
AU  - Yan, Hongmei
AU  - Ding, Jiyang
AU  - Wang, Ruwen
AU  - Feng, Yonghao
AU  - Zhang, Xinyi
AU  - Kong, Xingyu
