TI  - Selenoprotein P deficiency protects against immobilization-induced muscle atrophy by suppressing atrophy-related E3 ubiquitin ligases.
AU  - Abuduwaili, Halimulati
AU  - Kamoshita, Kyoko
AU  - Ishii, Kiyo-Aki
AU  - Takahashi, Kenta
AU  - Abuduyimiti, Tuerdiguli
AU  - Qifang, Li
