TI  - UBE2D2 is not involved in MuRF1-dependent muscle wasting during hindlimb suspension.
AU  - Polge, Cécile
AU  - Koulmann, Nathalie
AU  - Claustre, Agnès
AU  - Jarzaguet, Marianne
