TI  - Decreased expression of H19/miR-675 ameliorates muscle atrophy by regulating the IGF1R/Akt/FoxO signaling pathway.
AU  - Zhang, He
AU  - Wang, Fei
AU  - Pang, Xiangsheng
AU  - Zhou, Yue
AU  - Li, Shiming
AU  - Li, Wenjiong
AU  - Zhang, Peng
AU  - Chen, Xiaoping
