TI  - Biological sex divergence in transcriptomic profiles during the onset of hindlimb unloading-induced atrophy.
AU  - Tsitkanou, Stavroula
AU  - Morena da Silva, Francielly
AU  - Cabrera, Ana Regina
AU  - Schrems, Eleanor R.
AU  - Murach, Kevin A.
AU  - Washington, Tyrone A.
