TI  - Celecoxib attenuates hindlimb unloading-induced muscle atrophy via suppressing inflammation, oxidative stress and ER stress by inhibiting STAT3.
AU  - Ji, Yanan
AU  - Lin, Junfei
AU  - Liu, Ruiqi
