TI  - Effect of enhanced muscle tone on the expression of atrogenes and cytoskeletal proteins during postural muscle unloading.
AU  - Belova, Svetlana P.
AU  - Kalashnikova, Ekaterina P.
AU  - Tyganov, Sergey A.
AU  - Kostrominova, Tatiana Y.
AU  - Shenkman, Boris S.
AU  - Nemirovskaya, Tatiana L.
