TI  - Carbon monoxide-loaded cell therapy as an exercise mimetic for sarcopenia treatment.
AU  - Noguchi, Isamu
AU  - Maeda, Hitoshi
AU  - Kobayashi, Kazuki
AU  - Nagasaki, Taisei
