TI  - Effect of short-term hindlimb immobilization on skeletal muscle atrophy and the transcriptome in a low compared with high responder to endurance training model.
AU  - Thompson, Jamie-Lee M.
AU  - West, Daniel W. D.
AU  - Doering, Thomas M.
