TI  - Endoplasmic Reticulum Stress and Autophagy Markers in Soleus Muscle Disuse-Induced Atrophy of Rats Treated with Fish Oil.
AU  - Marzuca-Nassr, Gabriel Nasri
AU  - Kuwabara, Wilson Mitsuo Tatagiba
AU  - Vitzel, Kaio Fernando
