TI  - Leucine and HMB differentially modulate proteasome system in skeletal muscle under different sarcopenic conditions.
AU  - Baptista, Igor L.
AU  - Silva, Willian J.
AU  - Artioli, Guilherme G.
AU  - Guilherme, Joao Paulo L. F.
AU  - Leal, Marcelo L.
