TY  - JOUR
TI  - Mechano-signalling pathways in an experimental intensive critical illness myopathy model.
AU  - Corpeno Kalamgi, Rebeca
AU  - Salah, Heba
AU  - Gastaldello, Stefano
AU  - Martinez-Redondo, Vicente
