TI  - Preferential skeletal muscle myosin loss in response to mechanical silencing in a novel rat intensive care unit model: underlying mechanisms.
AU  - Ochala, Julien
AU  - Gustafson, Ann-Marie
AU  - Diez, Monica Llano
AU  - Renaud, Guillaume
