TI  - Effects of Nandrolone in the Counteraction of Skeletal Muscle Atrophy in a Mouse Model of Muscle Disuse: Molecular Biology and Functional Evaluation.
AU  - Camerino, Giulia Maria
AU  - Desaphy, Jean-François
AU  - De Bellis, Michela
AU  - Capogrosso, Roberta Francesca
AU  - Cozzoli, Anna
AU  - Dinardo, Maria Maddalena
AU  - Caloiero, Roberta
