TI  - Paracrine effects of IGF-1 overexpression on the functional decline due to skeletal muscle disuse: molecular and functional evaluation in hindlimb unloaded  MLC/mIgf-1 transgenic mice.
AU  - Pierno, Sabata
AU  - Camerino, Giulia M.
AU  - Cannone, Maria
AU  - Liantonio, Antonella
AU  - De Bellis, Michela
